concept:national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023-sch-1-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 After subsection 187(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (1A) Without limiting subsection (1), the legislative instrument may make requirements that depend on the making of a decision of an administrative character by the National VET Regulator.  (1B) To avoid doubt, the reference to person in paragraph (1)(b) includes a person from time to time holding, occupying or performing the duties of a specified office or position, even if the office or position does not come into existence until after the Ministerial Council’s agreement is given.  Schedule 1  Amendments  National Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data Streamlining) Amendment Act 2023 No. 49, 2023" ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (1A) Without limiting subsection (1), the legislative instrument may make requirements that depend on the making of a decision of an administrative character by the National VET Regulator.  (1B) To avoid doubt, the reference to person in paragraph (1)(b) includes a person from time to time holding, occupying or performing the duties of a specified office or position, even if the office or position does not come into existence until after the Ministerial Council’s agreement is given.  Schedule 1  Amendments  National Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data Streamlining) Amendment Act 2023 No. 49, 2023"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
