doc:sch-6-sec-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "2 Application of amendments" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "The amendments to sections 210A and 210B of the Principal Act made by Schedule 1 to the Amending Act apply to the use, disclosure or release of information on or after the commencement time, regardless of whether the information was collected before, on or after the commencement time." ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .

concept:national-vocational-education-and-training-regulator-data-streamlining-amendment-act-2023-sch-6-sec-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Saving of Data Provision Requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-3 ;
    values:originalText "Requirements made under subsection 187(1) of the Principal Act that were in force immediately before the commencement time continue in force (and may be dealt with) as if they had been made under that subsection as amended by the Amending Act.    No. 49, 2023 National Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data Streamlining) Amendment Act 2023  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 9 March 2023 Senate on 24 March 2023]  (23/23)" ;
    skos:definition "Requirements made under subsection 187(1) of the Principal Act that were in force immediately before the commencement time continue in force (and may be dealt with) as if they had been made under that subsection as amended by the Amending Act.    No. 49, 2023 National Vocational Education and Training Regulator (Data Streamlining) Amendment Act 2023  [Minister’s second reading speech made in— House of Representatives on 9 March 2023 Senate on 24 March 2023]  (23/23)"@en ;
